    "path": "html-next/components.md"
  },
  "behavior": [
    "Indexing, computed and structural aliases preserve owned entry identity; lexical shadowing does not replace the owning list.",
    "Conditional/default expressions and new containers can select entries from several own lists. Slot-prop conversion covers all candidate tags.",
    "Null and absent entries render fallback. Compatible copied records and foreign branches do not acquire ownership.",
    "Angular computed values retain references, Vue slot props use an allocated object alias, and compiled Vanilla carries logical invocation slot routing independently of root attributes."
  ],
